---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Privacy Policy | Infinilink Broadband" 
  description="Privacy Policy for Infinilink Broadband subscribers and website visitors in Wise County, Texas."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-slate-950 text-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-800 pb-8 mb-12">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-400 border border-cyan-800 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Customer Data Protection
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
          Last Updated: March 2026 • Infinilink Broadband
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Sections -->
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-slate max-w-none space-y-10 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        
        <section class="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Our Privacy Commitment</h2>
          <p>
            This privacy policy discloses the privacy practices for Infinilink Broadband and any information gathered through our website (<a href="https://www.infinilinkbroadband.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">infinilinkbroadband.com</a>), our customer portal, or directly through member interactions with our team.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We are the sole owners of the information collected on this site. <strong class="text-white">We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information to anyone.</strong> We only have access to or collect information that you voluntarily provide to us via contact forms, service applications, email, phone, or billing transactions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>
            When you check address availability, submit an inquiry, or subscribe to internet service, we may collect:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li>Contact details such as your full name, telephone number, and email address.</li>
            <li>Physical address and coordinates to verify line-of-sight signal coverage with our local Wise County towers.</li>
            <li>Billing and payment information processed through secure, PCI-compliant payment gateways.</li>
            <li>Technical diagnostic telemetry required to verify transceiver signal quality and network uptime.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>
            We use your information exclusively to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li>Respond to your inquiries, schedule on-site site surveys, and perform field installations.</li>
            <li>Provide reliable high-speed broadband and customer tech support.</li>
            <li>Process monthly invoices and manage your subscriber account.</li>
            <li>Notify you regarding scheduled network maintenance, tower enhancements, or service updates.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Information Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
          <p>
            We will not share your personal information with any third party outside of our organization, other than as necessary to fulfill your request (for example, secure payment processing or dispatching local field technicians). We do not partner with third-party ad networks to sell or monetize customer browsing habits or traffic logs.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. Data Security Safeguards</h2>
          <p>
            We take comprehensive precautions to protect your information both online and offline. When you submit sensitive information via the website or customer billing portal, your information is protected with industry-standard TLS/SSL encryption.
          </p>
          <p>
            While encryption protects information transmitted online, we also protect your information offline. Only employees who require access to perform specific tasks (such as customer billing or local field service dispatch) are granted access to personally identifiable information. Our systems and servers are kept in secure, restricted hosting environments.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">5. Your Access & Control Over Information</h2>
          <p>
            You may opt out of any future promotional communications from us at any time. You can contact us via phone or email to:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
            <li>Review what data we maintain regarding your account, if any.</li>
            <li>Change or correct any inaccurate personal data.</li>
            <li>Request deletion of non-essential records upon termination of service.</li>
            <li>Express any concern you have about our use of your information.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact & Mailing Block -->
        <section class="bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl mt-10">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mb-4">
            If you feel that we are not abiding by this privacy policy or have questions about how your data is handled, please contact us immediately:
          </p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
            <div>
              <p class="font-bold text-white">Infinilink Broadband</p>
              <p>101 Cooper Ct</p>
              <p>Runaway Bay, TX 76426</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p><strong class="text-white">Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:9404370550" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">(940) 437-0550</a></p>
              <p><strong class="text-white">Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@infinilinkbroadband.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline">support@infinilinkbroadband.com</a></p>
              <p><strong class="text-white">Customer Portal:</strong> <a href="https://billing.infinilinkbroadband.com" class="text-cyan-400 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">billing.infinilinkbroadband.com</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
